        "TileImage": "$($repository 6a3ae9cb-1a19-4748-8450-6d241eb46e6b).Image",
        "Description": "You are Tobias Rieper, A Bladerunner in China, 2047\r\rAn anonymous tip came in earlier and alerted us to the ever-growing presence of Replicant rebels in Chongqing, they have infilitrated and are presumably planning to further infiltrate a key ICA facility located below the city. \r\rBuck Mckeever, Valentine Bloomer, Andrew Pritchard, James Gordon and Diana Rivera, these are your targets, their likenesses are included in this file. \r\rAndrew Pritchard calls the shots.\r\rIt&apos;s retirement day, Tobias.",
